{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14887","headline":"郊居对雨寄赵涓给事包佶郎中 · 卢纶","name":"郊居对雨寄赵涓给事包佶郎中","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"暑雨青山里，随风到野居。\n乱沤浮曲砌，悬溜响前除。\n尘镜愁多掩，蓬头嬾更梳。\n夜窗凄枕席，阴壁润图书。\n萧飒宜新竹，龙钟拾野蔬。\n石泉空自咽，药圃不堪锄。\n浊水淙深辙，荒兰拥败渠。\n繁枝留宿鸟，碎浪出寒鱼。\n桑屐时登望，荷衣自卷舒。\n应怜在泥滓，无路托高车。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"卢纶","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_14887.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14887","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}